0..53 Comment "//! `imported` includes a theory from another source."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..133 Comment "//! `PointedMonoid` extends the imported `Monoid` with `point`. `Successor`"
134..212 Comment "//! models the extension with an integer successor. `include` names a block of"
213..287 Comment "//! an imported source unqualified, as it names a block of its own source."
